## Content

The **content** bundled in this repository is **not** freely licensed and is
included for personal, non-commercial, educational use only:

- **Canon dialogue and lore** (`databank/`, per-Heir `personal-memories.md`,
  `src/characters/*.json` persona data derived from it) — © HoYoverse
  / COGNOSPHERE Pte. Ltd., *Honkai: Star Rail*.
- **Official artwork** (`assets/heirs/`, `assets/avatars/`) — © HoYoverse.
- **Area artwork** (`assets/galgame/`) — from the *Honkai: Star Rail* wiki
  (Fandom), © HoYoverse, images credited in `docs/ATTRIBUTIONS.md`.
- **Wiki lore dump** (`databank/wiki/`) — from the *Honkai: Star Rail* wiki
  (Fandom), used under the **CC BY-SA 3.0** license; attribution in
  `docs/ATTRIBUTIONS.md`.

Do not redistribute the content commercially, and keep the attribution.

## Models

The model files are **not distributed** in this repository (see `.gitignore` /
`docs/DOWNLOADS.md`). They are open-source model weights from their respective
owners (Google — Gemma; DeepSeek; Alibaba — Qwen; Systran/OpenAI — Whisper) and
are subject to each project's own license.
